# Tes Modul 7 — Spesifikasi Penerimaan (Bagian C). Jalankan BERURUTAN.
# Sebelum mulai: migration 004 sudah dijalankan dan 12 user contoh
# (user1..user12) sudah dimasukkan lewat psql.

@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### 0. Login admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Rahasia123!" }

# ================= 9.1 Cursor pagination =================

### 1a. Halaman 1 (terbaru dulu: user12, user11, ... ; has_more true)
# @name page1
GET {{base}}/users?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 1b. Halaman 2 (memakai next_cursor dari halaman 1)
# @name page2
GET {{base}}/users?limit=5&cursor={{page1.response.body.$.meta.next_cursor}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 1c. Halaman 3 (halaman terakhir: has_more false, TANPA next_cursor)
GET {{base}}/users?limit=5&cursor={{page2.response.body.$.meta.next_cursor}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

# ================= 9.2 Data baru masuk di tengah jalan =================

### 2a. Sisipkan satu user baru (201; 409 bila tes diulang — tidak apa-apa)
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{ "username": "penyusup", "email": "p@x.ac.id", "password": "rahasia99" }

### 2b. Ambil ulang halaman 2 dengan cursor LAMA (isinya harus sama dengan 1b)
GET {{base}}/users?limit=5&cursor={{page1.response.body.$.meta.next_cursor}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

# ================= 9.3 Validasi deklaratif (harus 422) =================

### 3a. Semua salah sekaligus (422, tiga field dilaporkan bersamaan)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "a b!", "email": "bukan-email", "password": "abc" }

### 3b. Password terlalu umum (422)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "coba01", "email": "c@unair.ac.id", "password": "password123" }

### 3c. Password tanpa angka (422)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "coba02", "email": "c@unair.ac.id", "password": "tanpaangka" }

### 3d. Password kuat DITERIMA (201; 409 bila tes diulang)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "coba03", "email": "c3@unair.ac.id", "password": "KuatSekali77" }

### 3e. PATCH username kosong TETAP diperiksa (422 "minimal 3 karakter")
PATCH {{base}}/users/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{ "username": "" }

### 3f. PATCH tanpa field apa pun (400)
PATCH {{base}}/users/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{}

### 3g. PATCH sah (200)
PATCH {{base}}/users/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{ "is_active": true }

# ================= 9.4 Content negotiation =================

### 4a. Minta CSV (200, Content-Type text/csv, BERISI data)
GET {{base}}/users?limit=3
Accept: text/csv
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 4b. Minta XML (406 NOT_ACCEPTABLE)
GET {{base}}/users?limit=3
Accept: application/xml
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 4c. Accept */* (200 JSON)
GET {{base}}/users?limit=3
Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

# ================= 9.5 Keseragaman response kegagalan =================

### 5a. GET /users/999999 (404 NOT_FOUND)
GET {{base}}/users/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 5b. Cursor rusak (400 BAD_REQUEST)
GET {{base}}/users?cursor=bukanbase64!!
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 5c. Endpoint tidak ada (404 NOT_FOUND)
GET {{base}}/tidakada

### 5d. Tanpa token (401 UNAUTHORIZED)
GET {{base}}/users

### 5e. Content-Type text/plain (415 UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE)
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: text/plain
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

halo

### 5f. JSON rusak (400 BAD_REQUEST)
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{rusak

### 5g. is_active bukan boolean (400 BAD_REQUEST)
GET {{base}}/users?is_active=mungkin
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

# ================= 9.6 Kegagalan server =================
# Jalankan dulu di terminal:
#   psql -d praktikum_backend -c "ALTER TABLE users RENAME COLUMN email TO email_x;"
# lalu kirim request di bawah, lalu KEMBALIKAN:
#   psql -d praktikum_backend -c "ALTER TABLE users RENAME COLUMN email_x TO email;"

### 6. Database rusak (500 INTERNAL_ERROR, tanpa detail teknis)
GET {{base}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
